:349,"height":480,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/California_State_University_Sacramento_AROTC_SSI.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/California_State_University_Sacramento_AROTC_SSI.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:California_State_University_Sacramento_AROTC_SSI.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=23321161","sha1":"502b667d120a893aaf66d7cbeb7454ab68adaf95","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2012-12-25 00:12:17","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"California State University Sacramento AROTC SSI","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US Government|Shoulder Sleeve Insignia of the United States Army (SSI)|Vector version available|CC-PD-Mark|Quarterly or and vert|ROTC, California State University, Sacramento","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Description\n<p>On a quartered yellow and green rectangle arched convexly at top and bottom with a 1/8 inch (.32 cm) black border, a diagonal sword, white with black handle, from upper left to lower right point to base; between in second quarter, a yellow stylized hornet with white wings; and in third quarter, the white dome of the California State Capitol Building.  Attached above the rectangle, a yellow arched scroll edged with a 1/8 inch (. 32 cm) black border and inscribed “CSUS” in black letters.  Attached below the rectangle, a yellow arched scroll edged with a 1/8 inch (. 32 cm) black  border and inscribed “HORNETS” in black letters. \n</p><p>Symbolism\nThe green and yellow quartered shield reflects the four semesters of the ROTC advanced course and alludes to the leadership excellence patch.  The sword represents the military leadership training of the Cadets.  The hornet denotes the school’s mascot.  The capitol dome recalls the school’s location and symbolizes the state university system and the academic standards of the university.  \n</p><p>Background\n</p>\nThe shoulder loop insignia was approved on 29 July 1991. (TIOH Drawing Number A-10S-74)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2011-07-21 09:57:29","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.tioh.hqda.pentagon.mil/Heraldry/SROTC/SROTC_School.aspx?s=8372\">http://www.tioh.hqda.pentagon.mil/Heraldry/SROTC/SROTC_School.aspx?s=8372</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Institute of Heraldry","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}],"revisions":[{"revid":845966905,"parentid":844624125,"timestamp":"2024-01-27T06:13:48Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"=={{int:filedesc}}==\n{{Information\n|description={{en|1=Description\nOn a quartered yellow and green rectangle arched convexly at top and bottom with a 1/8 inch (.32 cm) black border, a diagonal sword, white with black handle, from upper left to lower right point to base; between in second quarter, a yellow stylized hornet with white wings; and in third quarter, the white dome of the California State Capitol Building.  Attached above the rectangle, a yellow arched scroll edged with a 1/8 inch (. 32 cm) black border and inscribed “CSUS” in black letters.  Attached below the rectangle, a yellow arched scroll edged with a 1/8 inch (. 32 cm) black  border and inscribed “HORNETS” in black letters. \n\nSymbolism\nThe green and yellow quartered shield reflects the four semesters of the ROTC advanced course and alludes to the leadership excellence patch.  The sword represents the military leadership training of the Cadets.  The hornet denotes the school’s mascot.  The capitol dome recalls the school’s location and symbolizes the state university system and the academic standards of the university.  \n\nBackground\nThe shoulder loop insignia was approved on 29 July 1991. (TIOH Drawing Number A-10S-74)}}\n|date=2011-07-21 09:57:29\n|source=http://www.tioh.hqda.pentagon.mil/Heraldry/SROTC/SROTC_School.aspx?s=8372\n|author=Institute of Heraldry\n|permission=\n|other_versions=\n|other_fields=\n}}\n\n=={{int:license-header}}==\n{{PD-USGov}}\n\n{{Vector version available|California State University Sacramento AROTC SSI (vect).svg}}\n\n[[Category:ROTC, California State University, Sacramento]]\n[[Category:Shoulder Sleeve Insignia of the United States Army (SSI)]]\n[[Category:Quarterly or and vert]]"}}}]},{"pageid":31963880,"ns":6,"title":"File:US Army Eighty-Eighth Army Band SSI (Urban).svg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"timestamp":"2014-04-03T01:41:28Z","user":"Bassoonstuff","size":35535,"width":774,"height":891,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/US_Army_Eighty-Eighth_Army_Band_SSI_%28Urban%29.svg/500px-US_Army_Eighty-Eighth_Army_Band_SSI_%28Urban%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":417,"thumbheight":480,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/US_Army_Eighty-Eighth_Army_Band_SSI_%28Urban%29.svg/960px-US_Army_Eighty-Eighth_Army_Band_SSI_%28Urban%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm